See [http://groups.yahoo.com/group/lojban/message/1999

__((xo'a))__]     XOhA     Loglan toggle: Toggles text to TLI Loglan; marks following text as TLI Loglan; Lojban equivalent of experimental Loglan "hoa" (which toggles text to Lojban)
* We use xo'a, and Loglan, were it really around, would be using hoa.
* The ''o'' and ''a'' are the vowels of ''Loglan'' and ''Lojban''.
